# Word and table data for 240 J₂ conjugators

The five generator words and the 240 words in those generators are explicit
witness data. Their interpretations in the actual carrier and centralizing
identities are established in `OrbitRepresentatives`. No centralizer order
or completeness claim is part of this data module.

Source: the retained ATLAS `J2G1-p100B0` permutations; GLS3, Table 5.3g
for the outer-group application. The data-generation scripts supply witnesses
only. Every finite identity claimed in this module is checked by Lean.
